      "id": "claim_069b6622f456401b8eeb7326226f1505",
      "statement": "The Makefile defines make test (compiles integration-tagged tests under tests/actions/ without running them, then runs `go test -v ./...`; SQLite-backed store tests run by default, Postgres-backed store tests are skipped unless TEST_POSTGRES_URL is set), make test-race (`go test -race -v ./...`), make test-coverage (`go test -coverprofile=coverage.out ./...` plus `go tool cover` HTML rendering), make test-integration (starts the server via make run, runs scripts/test-api.sh, then stops the server), and make test-api (runs scripts/test-api.sh against an already-running server).",
