      "id": "claim_6e181ae2ef974a899fb2ceb39eb4ab40",
      "statement": "TESTING.md's documented unit test conventions are: no third-party test frameworks (stdlib testing + net/http/httptest only), table-driven subtests via t.Run, Test<Type>_<Method>[_<Scenario>] naming, per-test isolation (each test builds its own handler/store instance and logger, no shared mutable state), and t.Errorf for non-fatal checks versus t.Fatalf for preconditions that would make further assertions meaningless.",
